  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "SessionManager is the core persistence service responsible for managing the complete lifecycle of application sessions, storing state as JSON files within a sandboxed root directory. It provides robust methods for loading, saving, updating, and deleting sessions while strictly enforcing path boundaries to prevent directory traversal attacks. This service abstracts file I/O and JSON serialization, acting as the dedicated persistence layer for session data within the application's service architecture."
  },
